<title>ZAIRE: Zaire announces crisis cabinet.</title>
<headline>Zaire announces crisis cabinet.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaire's President Mobutu Sese Seko signed a decree on Tuesday forming a crisis cabinet to take charge of the battle with rebels in the east of the Central African country, state television announced.</p>
<p>Centrist Prime Minister Kengo wa Dondo was retained at the head of the government, which includes at least one member of the radical opposition. Powerful Interior Minister Kamanda wa Kamanda was moved to the Foreign Ministry.</p>
</text>
